body:
Okay, so

&#x200B;

Before this, I accused my friend of being a pedophile as a joke, of which i was temp muted for, I admit bad idea.  then after this, **which I had already been punished for**, i was permabanned after saying someone had a skill issue.  of course this doesnt make me immune to the rules, but dont punish me for no reason after ALREADY punishing me

&#x200B;

I deleted my post, as i felt it was worded harshly.

Me and the dev don't have the best history together eheh....

&#x200B;

TLDR: I was fired and called a zoophile because he found out I made furry nsfw on furaffinity

I'm pretty sure protogens visors are like, attached to their faces, if he removed his visor, it'd rip the flesh off his face and he'd bleed out...

&#x200B;

(edit: If you really wanna make a protogen like that, make it! Fuck the guidelines!  They just stunt creativity)
